\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \tab \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Nachtrag I/Prommer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , f. 132v. \endash  J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gretser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , De Cruce Christi Tomus Secundus. In quo varia Graecorum auctorum encomiastica monumenta Graecolatina de SS. Cruce continentur \u8230 \'85, Ingolstadt 1600, S. 566\endash 569, 571\endash 572, 580 (Hs. benutzt). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rwarth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 84. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gretser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Opera, Sp. 2699\endash 2702 (= \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gretser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , De Cruce Christi, S. 566\endash 569), 2706\endash 2707 (= a. O., S. 571\endash 572), 2710 (= a. O., S. 580) (Hs. benutzt). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hardt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   III, S. 136\endash 137. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Voge\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 l\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gardthausen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 25 (irrt\u252 \'fcmlich Andreas Darmarios zugeschrieben). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vorst\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Delehaye, S. 117.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tinnefeld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 328, 332, 334, 340 (Anm. 131). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hajd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u250 \'fa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Darmarios, S. 125. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dies.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Sammlung, S. 57 (Anm. 184). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 J. W. Nesbitt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Some Observations on Jakob Gretser\rquote s Edition of Alexander the Monk\rquote s \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  De inventione sanctae crucis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  (BHG \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  410; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  CPG \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  7398), in: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 B. Janssens / B. Roosen / P. Van Deun\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), Philo\-mathestatos. Studies in Greek and Byzantine Texts presented to Jacques Noret for his Sixty-Fifth Birthday. \u201 \'c9tudes de patristique grecque et textes byzantins offerts \u224 \'e0 Jacques Noret \u224 \'e0 l\rquote occasion de ses soixante-cinq ans (OLA 137), L\u246 \'f6wen / Paris / Dudley (MA) 2004, S. 475\endash 486, hier S. 475\endash 476 (Anm. 3).}

