33\fs20  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u917 \'c5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u917 \'c5\u917 \'c5\u914 \'c2\u931 \'d3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   6 (1928), S. 375\endash 386, hier S. 380\endash 381 mit Abb. 5. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hobson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 261. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hajd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u250 \'fa\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Sammlung, S. 26 (Anm. 38), 63 (Anm. 212). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 M. Capone Ciollaro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Un ricettario medico attribuito a Giovanni Archiatra, in: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 V. Boudon-Millot / A. Garzya / J. Jouanna / A. Roselli \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  (Hrsg.), Ecdotica e ricezione dei testi medici greci (Atti del V Convegno Internazionale, Napoli 1\endash 2 ottobre 2004), Neapel 2006, S. 213\endash 230, hier S. 213, 214 mit Anm. 15. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 B. Zipser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), John the Physician\rquote s \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Therapeutics\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . A Medical Handbook in Vernacular Greek (Studies in Ancient Medicine 37), Leiden / Boston 2009, S. 13 (Anm. 32 und 33), 18, 20, 22, 30\endash 32, 43 (Hs. benutzt).}

