\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Procopius Gazaeus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Catena in Canticum Canticorum, PG 87\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 1712, B 4\endash 5 und 1\endash 3; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 J.-M. Auwers\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Procopii Gazaei Epitome in Canticum Canticorum (CCSG 67), Turnhout 2011, S. 337\endash 338 (Nr. 280 und 279); CPG III u. III A 7431.}

