\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1. (ff. 1r\endash 10v. 12r\endash v. 11r\endash v. 14r\endash v. 13r\endash v. 15r\endash 53v) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Manuel Moschopulus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Erotemata grammaticalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf18  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (Ms. [\u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8058 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8183 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\u969 \'f9\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , b] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. Grammaticae artis Graecae methodus Manuele Moschopulo authore. Eiusdem artis Theodori Gazae lib. II, Basel: Ex officina Ioan. Vualder, 1540; VD 16 M 689; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   S. 155, 12 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u965 \'f5\u968 \'f8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u965 \'f5\u968 \'f8\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Titelbeginn (f. 1r) nach dem Titel auf f. 7r erg\u228 \'e4nzt: \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u967 \'f