\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \tab \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Nachtrag I/Prommer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , f. 133r. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rwarth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 64. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ardt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   III, S. 240\endash 241. \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vogel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gardthausen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 25. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 A. Pos\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 t\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Vatican Plato and its Relations, Middletown (CT) 1934, S. 89 (falsche Inhaltsangabe). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H. D. Saffrey, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Sur la tradition manuscrite de la Th\u233 \'e9ologie platonicienne de Proclus, in: Autour d\rquote Aristote. Recueil d\rquote \u233 \'e9tudes de philosophie ancienne et m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale offert \u224 \'e0 Msgr. A. Mansion, L\u246 \'f6wen 1955, S. 387\endash 430, hier S. 392. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 R. S. Brumbaugh\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 R. Wells\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), Plato Manuscripts: A Catalogue of Microfilms in the Plato Microfilm Project, Yale University Library, II: Mss. in Austria, Czechoslovakia, France \u8230 \'85; Addenda to Part I, New Haven (CT) 1962, S. 40 (Nr. 1522). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dies.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), The Plato Manuscripts. A New Index, New Haven (CT) / London 1968, S. 29. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H. D. Saffrey \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 /\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  L. G. Westerink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), Proclus, Th\u233 \'e9ologie platonicienne, I, Paris 1968, S. XCVIII. \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tinnefeld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 329, 333, 334. \endash  R. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 S. Brumbaugh\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Plato Manuscripts: Toward a Completed Inventory, in: Manuscripta 34 (1990), S. 114\endash 121, hier S. 116. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hajd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u250 \'fa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Darmarios, S. 126. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Dies., \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Sammlung, S. 57 (Anm. 184).}

