\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 7r\endash 132r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Proclus Diadochus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Theologia platonica; lib. IV (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4), edd. H. D. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Saffrey \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / L. G. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Westerink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proclus, Th\u233 \'e9ologie platonicienne, IV, Paris 1981, S. 1\endash 113.\endash  Einige Randscholien, manchmal als Diagramme gestaltet, in Rot und in der braunen Schreib\-tinte (s. ff. 73r, 79v, 121r, 125r\endash v), alle ediert in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Saffrey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Westerink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., IV, S. 116\endash 118 (Scholia codicis Parisini). \endash  (f. 73r) erstes Scholion (zu IV 21): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u925 \'cd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u968 \'f8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Saffrey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Westerink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., S. 116. \endash  (f. 125v) letztes Scholion (zu IV 39): erkl\u228 \'e4rende Zeichnung zum Wort \u7957 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Saffrey\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Westerink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., S. 118. \endash  Davor: (ff. 1r\endash 6r) Kapitel\-verzeichnis (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Am Rand Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung in roter Tinte. \endash  (f. 6v) leer. \endash  Am Textende: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u