 \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\u8179 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8150 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8179 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8135 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \rquote  \u8005 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \u7972 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8033 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\u8115 ?. \endash  Zu dem Philosophen, Architekten, Aristoteles-U\u776 ?bersetzer und Philologen Ciriaco Strozzi (Cyriacus Strozza [1504\endash 1560 oder 1565]) vgl. u. a. \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Z. Monti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b, Vita Kyriaci Strozae Auctior, Paris 1604, \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 G. Allegrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b, Elogj degli uomini illustri toscani, III, Lucca 1772, S. CXLII\endash CXLVII, und zuletzt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 N. Zorzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Il gre\-cista Chirico Strozzi (1504\endash 65): notizie sulla biografia, le lettere, gli scritti, in: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 G. Fiacca\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \-\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 dori / A. Gatti / S. Marotta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u171 \'abIn partibus Clius\u187 \'bb. Scritti in onore di Giovanni Pugliese Carratelli (Istituto Italiano per gli Studi Filoso\-fici, Biblioteca Europea 36), Neapel 2006, S. \u8249 \'8b355\u8250 \'9b\endash 459. Derselbe Text mit Zuschreibung an Strozzi in Cod. Vat. gr. 1722, ff. 314r\endash 329v (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 C. Giannelli / P. Canart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Codices Vatica\-ni graeci. Codices 1684\endash 1744, Vatikanstadt 1961, S. 99\endash 101, hier S. 100 [mit Fragezeichen]), vgl. dazu auch \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 G. Allegrini\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b, a. O., S. CXLV\endash CXLVI (Anm. 1), und\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  Zorzi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., S. 412\endash 414. }

