52r\endash 75r) Antiochius sive Misopogon (Ms. \u7992 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7944 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u967 \'f7\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7970 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8061 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Lacombrade\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., S. 156\endash 199; edd. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 C. Prato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 D.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Micalella\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Giuliano Impe\-ratore, Misopogon. Edizione critica, traduzione e commento, Rom 1979, S. 2\endash 80; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Prato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Micalella\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 42, 16 \u8001 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8050 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7936 ?\plain \f3\lan