\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 6r\endash 84r) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Onasander\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Strategicus (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8008 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Koechly\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Zu Beginn der meisten Kapitel Titel in Rot; in derselben Tinte die Kapitel\-z\u228 \'e4hlung am Rand. Prooemium als Kap. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 gez\u228 \'e4hlt; Einteilung der Kapitel oft abweichend von der Ausgabe. \endash  Davor: (ff. 1r\endash 4r) Kapitelverzeichnis (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8008 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\u903 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8023 ? \u7969 ? \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\u903 ? \u7985 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8050 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7970 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ?, \u8005 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8001 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u968 \'f8\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\endash  Am Ende des Kapitel\-verzeichnisses (f. 4r) in roter Tinte: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 4v, 84v) leer.}

