\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 1r\endash 182v) \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Acacius hieromonachus Cretensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Proscynetarium (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8058 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8134 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7937 ?\u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7993 ?\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u8052 ?\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u903 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8150 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7936 ?\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u8061 ?\u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u8055 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ed. princ.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Papadopulos-Kerameus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. <1>\endash 36, nach dieser Hs. \endash  Ms. ohne Kapiteleinteilung und Zwischen\u252 \'fcberschriften. Zahlw\u246 \'f6rter durchgehend in roter Tinte. 26 ganzseitige Federzeichnungen (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ill\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) als Illustration zum Text. \endash  (f. 182v) am Textende Subscriptio des Autors und Schreibers Acacius (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (f. 183r) weitere Subscriptio (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Leere Bl\u228 \'e4tter: ff. 8Av, 20Ar, 20Br\endash v, 36Ar, 36Br\endash v, 38Ar\endash v, 55Ar, 55Br\endash v, 63Ar\endash v, 63Bv, 67Av\endash 67Bv, 75Av\endash 75Bv, 91Ar, 91Bv, 115Br, 119Av, 119Bv, 123Av\endash 123Bv, 135Av\endash 135Bv, 139Ar\endash 139Br, 147Ar, 147Bv, 163Ar, 163Br\endash v, 171Av\endash 171Bv, 179Ar, 179Br\endash v, 183v, 185v\endash 189v. }

