\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  6. (ff. 70r\endash 80v) Exzerpt aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Theodosius Grammaticus Alexandrinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Canones isagogici de flexione nominum et verborum (Ms. ohne Titel), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hilgard\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Canones I, S. 83\endash 99; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   S. 83, 8 \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8118 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8165 ?\u8134 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8119 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Einige Textabweichungen bzw. K\u252 \'fcrzungen gegen\u252 \'fcber der Ausgabe. \endash  Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: (ff. 80v\endash 81v) grammatikalische Exzerpte sowie Abschnitte aus Lexika (Ms. \u8013 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7936 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8150 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7988 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u961 \'f1\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7936 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8005 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7936 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'