\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \tab \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Konkordanz/Prommer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , f. 130r. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rwarth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 85. \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hardt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   III, S. 194\endash 195. \endash \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 G. Mercati\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Notizie di Procoro e Demetrio Cidone, Manuele Caleca e Teodoro Meliteniota ed altri appunti per la storia della teologia e della letteratura bizantina del secolo XIV (StT 56), Vatikanstadt 1931, S. 6 (Anm. 3). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 J. Meyendorff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Intro\-duction a l\rquote \u233 \'e9tude de Gr\u233 \'e9goire Palamas (Patristica Sorbonensia 3), Paris 1959, S. 399 (Anm. 98). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 E. Voordeckers / F. Tinnefeld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), Iohannis Cantacuzeni Refutationes duae Prochori Cydonii et Disputatio cum Paulo patriarcha Latino epistulis septem tradita (CCSG 16), Turnhout / L\u246 \'f6wen 1987, S. LXXIV\endash LXXV, XCII\endash XCIII. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 P. Van Deun\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Quelques t\u233 \'e9moins nouveaux de l\rquote Hod\u232 \'e8gos d\rquote Anastase le Sina\u239 \'efte, in: REB 50 (1992), S. 231\endash 239, hier S. 236\endash 237. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 B. Markesinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Un floril\u232 \'e8ge compos\u233 \'e9 pour la d\u233 \'e9fense du tome du concile de 1351, in: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 A.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Schoors / P. van Deun\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), Philohist\u244 \'f4r. Miscellanea in honorem Caroli Laga septuagenarii (OLA 60), L\u246 \'f6wen / Paris / Walpole (MA) 1994, S. 469\endash 493, hier S. 474\endash 476, 482. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hajd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u250 \'fa\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  / Schreiner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaos, S. 42, 43.}

