n \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8033 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?), PG 101, 820\endash 821; edd. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 B. Laourdas \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 L. G. Westerink\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Photii patriarchae Constantinopolitani Epistulae et Amphilochia, V. Amphilochiorum pars altera, Leipzig 1986, S. 197\endash 198 (mit einigen Textabweichungen); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   S. 197, 17 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Karo / Lietzmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 44 (Catena in Psalmos et in Odas Typus XV; Prologi [Nr. 2]).}

