\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \tab \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stephanus-Katalog\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , f. 88r. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rwarth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 34. \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Hardt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   III, S. 229\endash 231. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Vorst\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Delehaye\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 120. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hartig\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 136, 242, 368. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 J. R. Martin\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The illustration of the Heavenly Ladder of John Climacus (Studies in Manuscript Illumination 5), Princeton 1954, S. 6. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 P. Canart\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nouveaux r\u233 \'e9cits du moine Anastase, in: Actes du XII\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs20 e\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   Congr\u232 \'e8s International d\rquote \u201 \'c9tudes Byzantines, Ochride 10\endash 16 septembre 1961, II, Belgrad 1964, S. 264 (Anm. 9). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hobson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 261. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hajd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u250 \'fa\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  Sammlung, S. 26 (Anm. 38). \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Uthemann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Anastasios Sinaites, S. 382\endash 383 mit Anm. 2, 390 (Anm. 4).}

