s20 , The v-Recension of St. Cyril\rquote s Lexicon, in: Illinois Classical Studies 4 (1979), S. <94>\endash 135, hier S. 105, 111\endash 112 (\u220 \'dcberlieferung), 113 (Teilstemma), 120 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Stemma codicum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), 121\endash 135 (Probe-Edition u. a. aus dieser Hs.). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 G. Cavallo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , La trasmissione scritta della cultura greca antica in Calabria e in Sicilia tra i secoli X\endash XV. Consistenza, tipologia, fruizione, in: S&C 4 (1980), S. <157>\endash 245, hier S. 190, 196. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ph. Euangelatu-Notara\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u931 \'d3\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8053 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u8222 \'84\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \ldblquote  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   13\plain \f2\super\lang1032\fs20 \u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   A\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ., Athen 1984, S. 15. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Haller / Dachs / Fabian\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 219. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 D. Arnesano\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Il repertorio dei codici greci salentini di Oronzo Mazzotta. Aggiornamenti e integrazioni, in: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 M. Spedicato\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), Tracce di storia. Studi in onore di mons. Oronzo Mazzotta (Societ\u224 \'e0 di Storia Patria, Sezione di Lecce/Quaderni de L\rquote Idomeneo 1), Galatina 2005, S. <25>\endash 80, hier S. 52 (mit weiterer Literatur zur Hs.). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hajd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u250 \'fa\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  / Schreiner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaos, S. 25\endash 52, hier S. 45.\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Hajd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u250 \'fa\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  / Schreiner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die B\u228 \'e4chlein, S. <137>\endash 168.}

