\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4. (ff. 176v\endash 181r) Nomos Stratiotikos (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u925 \'cd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \u8172 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 W. Ashburner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , The Byzantine Mutiny Act, in: The Journal of Hellenic Studies 46 (1926), S. 80\endash 109: S. 85\endash 109 (Kapitelreihenfolge nach Cod. Laud. gr. 39). \endash  In der Hs. einige Textabweichungen gegen\u252 \'fcber der Ausgabe sowie eine andere Kapitel\-reihenfolge: Kap. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ashburner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u987 ?\u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \u987 ?\u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u987 ?\u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u987 ?\u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u950 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u950 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u987 ?\u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u950 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u987 ?\u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u950 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u950 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 = \u987 ?\u180 \'b4 (!), \u8249 \'8b\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\u8250 \'9b\endash \u8249 \'8b\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\u8250 \'9b = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, \u8249 \'8b\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\u8250 \'9b = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 (!), \u8249 \'8b\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\u8250 \'9b\endash \u8249 \'8b\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u950 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\u8250 \'9b = \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u987 ?\u180 \'b4. Kap. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ashburner \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (s. S. 101) fehlt. \endash  Am Rand unvollst\u228 \'e4ndige Kapitelz\u228 \'e4hlung (Kap. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\endash \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4) in Rot und in der braunen Schreibtinte.}

