959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Zu dem auf f. 2v (4.\endash 20. Z.) \u252 \'fcberlieferten Abschnitt \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u953 \'e9\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u956 \'ec\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\u973 \'fd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8049 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u8054 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u8051 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u7952 ?\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . ... \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u8150 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f4\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u8051 ?\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 A. Severyns\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Pomme de discorde et Jugement des d\u233 \'e9esses, in: Phoibos, V, M\u233 \'e9langes Joseph Hombert (1950\endash 1951), S. <145>\endash 172, hier S. 147, 1\endash 13.}

