\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \tab (ff. 1r\endash 11v) Lib. VI\endash VII 1 und VIII 218\endash 428; Z\u228 \'e4hlung nach \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Geffcken\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ms. \u7960 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [!] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4). \endash  (ff. 11v\endash 22r) Lib. IV (Ms. \u7960 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4). (f. 19r) Rand\-scholion (zu IV 141), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Geffcken\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 99 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  app. crit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (ff. 22r\endash 38v) Lib. XI (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4). \endash  (ff. 38v\endash 53v) Lib. XII (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4). \endash  (ff. 53v\endash 62v) Lib. X\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u921 \'c9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  II (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4). \endash  (ff. 62v\endash 81r) Lib. X\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u921 \'c9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  V (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8249 \'8b\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\u8057 ?\plain \f2\