ield{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u935 ?\u961 ?\u953 ?\u963 s\u964 t\u953 ?\u945 a\u957 ?\u8057 ?\u962 ?, \u956 \'b5\u8118 ?\u955 ?\u955 ?\u959 ?\u957 ? \u948 d\u8050 ? \u954 ?\u945 a\u8054 ? \u956 \'b5\u959 ?\u957 ?\u945 a\u967 ?\u8057 ?\u962 ?, \u7952 ?\u8048 ?\u957 ? \u8000 ?\u956 \'b5\u957 ?\u8059 ?\u8131 ? \u964 t\u8056 ? \u8004 ?\u957 ?\u959 ?\u956 \'b5\u945 a \u964 t\u959 ?\u8166 ? \u935 ?\u961 ?\u953 ?\u963 s\u964 t\u959 ?\u8166 ? \u7970 ? \u964 t\u8134 ?\u962 ? \u920 T\u949 e\u959 ?\u964 t\u8057 ?\u954 ?\u959 ?\u965 ? \u7970 ? \u7940 ?\u955 ?\u955 ?\u959 ?\u957 ? \u964 t\u953 ?\u957 ?\u8048 ? \u8005 ?\u961 ?\u954 ?\u959 ?\u957 ? \u954 ?\u964 t\u955 ?.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8020 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7940 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: (ff. 304r, 2. Z.\endash 305v) Praecepta quinque ad Christianos pertinentia (Ms. ohne Titel; Text direkt an das Vorangehende anschlie\u223 \'dfend); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8040 ?\u966 f\u949 e\u8055 ?\u955 ?\u949 e\u953 ? \u948 d\u8050 ? \u964 t\u959 ?\u8059 ?\u964 t\u959 ?\u953 ?\u962 ? \u7936 ?\u949 e\u8054 ? \u964 t\u959 ?\u8150 ?\u962 ? \u960 p\u8051 ?\u957 ?\u964 t\u949 e \u960 p\u8118 ?\u962 ? \u935 ?\u961 ?\u953 ?\u963 s\u964 t\u953 ?\u945 a\u957 ?\u8056 ?\u962 ? \u7952 ?\u957 ?\u945 a\u963 s\u967 ?\u959 ?\u955 ?\u949 e\u8150 ?\u963 s\u952 ?\u945 a\u953 ?\u903 ? \u960 p\u961 ?\u8182 ?\u964 t\u959 ?\u957 ?, \u956 \'b5\u949 e\u964 t\u945 a\u957 ?\u959 ?\u949 e\u8150 ?\u957 ? \u960 p\u945 a\u957 ?\u964 t\u8057 ?\u964 t\u949 e \u949 e\u7984 ?\u962 ? \u956 \'b5\u8051 ?\u947 ?\u945 a \u954 ?\u945 a\u8054 ? \u949 e\u7984 ?\u962 ? \u956 \'b5\u953 ?\u954 ?\u961 ?\u8056 ?\u957 ? \u954 ?\u964 t\u955 ?.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7940 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u969 \'f9\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Die Epitome (oder Didascalia) unter dem Namen des Theodorus Studita findet sich u. a. in Cod. Marc. gr. III 5, f. 190r\endash v (= coll. 1077; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Mioni\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [s. Nr. 6], S. 156\endash 168, hier S. 159), Cod. Vat. gr. 733, ff. 356\endash 358 (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Devreesse\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Codices, S. 238\endash 241, hier S. 240), und Cod. Sinait. Monasterii S. Aecaterinae gr. 1609, ff. 192v\endash 193r (vgl. \plain \f3\scaps\lang1024\fs24 V. Bene\plain \f3\scaps\lang1024\fs24 \u353 \'9a\plain \f3\scaps\lang1024\fs24 evi\plain \f3\scaps\lang1024\fs24 \u263 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Catalogus codicum manuscriptorum graecorum qui in monasterio Sanctae Catherinae in Monte Sina asservantur, III, 1, Sankt Petersburg 1917, S. 77\endash 105, hier S. 80\endash 81). Anhand der Kataloge l\u228 \'e4\u223 \'dft sich feststellen, dass sich auch in diesen Hss. die Praecepta quinque unmittelbar an die Epitome (s. oben) anschlie\u223 \'dfen.}

