\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  14. (ff. 90r\endash 95r) \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Manuel Adramyttenus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Epistula ad Angelum Politianum (Ms. M\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u8052 ?\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8001 ? \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7944 ?\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u8179 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u8183 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u8022 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8049 ?\u964 \'f4\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Legrand\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., S. 356\endash 358, nach dieser Hs.; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8013 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8050 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8001 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u8180 ?\u950 \'e6\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u8057 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u964 \'f4\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u8182 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u8189 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7985 ?\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u8051 ?\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u7956 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u885 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f2\super\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u965 \'f5\plain \f2\super\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u947 \'e3\plain \f2\super\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8189 ? \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u8059 ?\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Zur Datierung des Briefes (Mirandola, 4. Juli 1483) vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Megna\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., S. 382. \endash  Vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Gr\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24