\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2. (ff. 1Av\endash 4r) Anonyme Scholien zu \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Aphthonius Antiochenus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b, Progymnasmata, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), II, S. 5\endash 68, u. a. nach dieser Hs.; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des. imperfecte\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   S. 25, 13 (zu Kap. 4) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8050 ? \u7969 ? \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Scholien folgenderma\u223 \'dfen eingeteilt: (f. 1Av) Prolegomena (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (f. 2r) Explicatio fabulae (Ms. \u7960 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (f. 2r\endash v) Explicatio narrationis (Ms. \u7960 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (ff. 2v\endash 3v) Explicatio usus (Ms. \u7960 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). (ff. 3v\endash 4r) Explicatio sententiae (Ms. \u7960 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Die Prolegomena auf f. 1Av enthalten ebenso wie Cod. Vindob. phil. gr. 238 (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hunger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Katalog, S. 344\endash 346) eine k\u252 \'fcrzere Textrezension, s. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., II, S. 5\endash 6 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  app. crit.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Unmittelbar nach den Prolegomena: (f. 1Av, 21.\endash 31. Z.) \u8249 \'8bKapitelverzeichnis\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8013 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8001 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8005 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8118 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \rquote  \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8179 ?, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. 4v) leer.}

