\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b, \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7991 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\plain \f2\super\lang1032\fs24 \u953 \'e9\plain \f3\super\lang1024\fs24 \u729 \'ff\u729 \'ff\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [!]) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   S. 40, 24 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8061 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . (f. 20v [von Hand B]) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u965 \'f5\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7988 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7956 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \tab Auf ff. 6r und 7r einige schematisch dargestellte Randscholien aus den Kapiteln \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   des \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Nicolaus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Sophista\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Progymnasmata\u8250 \'9b, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 I. Felten\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Nicolai Progymnasmata (Rhetores Graeci 11), Leipzig 1913, S. 17\endash 29. \endash  Ab f. 7v durchgehend interlineare Glossen und anonyme Randscholien (nur auf f. 17v auf dem ganzen Blatt); Scholien in \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., II, S. 1\endash 68, ediert; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   S. 25, 15 (zu Progymn. V 1) \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ? \u8032 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u945 \'e1\u950 \'e6\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u965 \'f5\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   S. 68, 5 (zu Progymn. XIV 15) \u8249 \'8b\u8041 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Scholien meist durch Trennzeichen und Spatium voneinander abgesetzt, z. T. in roter Tinte nummeriert.}

