\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \tab Am Rand: \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Maximus Planudes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Scholia in Hermogenis De methodo sollertiae*\u8250 \'9b, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), V, S. 562\endash 576. \endash  Am Textende: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7961 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: (ff. 161v\endash 162v) \u8249 \'8bDe figuris in libris \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8017 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u941 \'dd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   et \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., III, S. 704\endash 711, anhand dieser Hs. \endash  (ff. 162v\endash 164v) \u8249 \'8bProblemata rhetorica in status\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Walz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O., VIII, S. 402\endash 413, anhand dieser Hs.; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Gl\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 ckner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 5\endash 7 (Textproben).}

