\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \tab \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stephanus-Katalog\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , ff. 88v\endash 89r. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rwarth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 80. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hardt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   III, S. 115\endash 117. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 C. L. Kayser\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), Flavii Philostrati opera, II, Leipzig 1871, S. XX. \endash  Seminariorum Vindobonensium Sodales (Hrsg.), Philostrati maioris Imagines, Leipzig 1893, S. XVI, XVIII (Nr. 35). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hartig\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 136, 242, 243, 368. \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Glauning\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 268, 273. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 J. A. Spranger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , A Preliminary Skeleton List of the Manuscripts of Euripides, in: CQ 33 (1939), S. 98\endash 107, hier S. 104 (Nr. 211). \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Lehmann\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   I, S. 62. \endash  A. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Turyn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Byzantine Manuscript Tradition of the Tragedies of Euripides (ISLL 43), Urbana 1957, S. 134. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 V. Ortoleva\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Massimo Planude e i \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Disticha Catonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Sileno 15 (1989), S. 105\endash 136, hier S. 108 (Anm. 9). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ders.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Una traduzione greca inedita dei \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Disticha Catonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , in: Sileno 16 (1990), S. 287\endash 300, hier S. 287 (Anm. 1). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H.-\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 C. G\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u252 \'fc\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 nther\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Manuscripts and the Transmission of the Paleologan Scholia on the Euripidean Triad (Hermes Einzelschriften 68), Stuttgart 1995, S. 85, 241. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hobson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 261. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hajd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u250 \'fa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sammlung, S. 26 (Anm. 38).}

