\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 1r\endash 13v) \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Maximus Planudes}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b, Catonis Disticha moralia Graece versa (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Disticha Catonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , g]), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 L. L. Luisides\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Versio Planudea dictorum Catonis, Athen 1947 (mir nicht zug\u228 \'e4nglich); ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 V. Ortoleva\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Maximus Planudes, Disticha Catonis in Graecum trans\-lata, Rom 1992; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc. mut.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ortoleva\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 5\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (I 17) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7988 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8150 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang103