\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 66r\endash 70r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Pantoleon presbyter Byzantinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Homilia in exaltationem crucis (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [!] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u963 \'f3\u946 \'e2\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\u965 \'f5\u950 \'e6\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u947 \'e3\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs2