\f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ? \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 86r\endash 87v) leer.}

