e bizantini inediti alle \u171 \'abOpere\u187 \'bb, in: Aevum 25.4 (1951), S. 342\endash 352, hier S. 346 (Anm. 3). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 A. Turyn\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Studies in the Manuscript Tradition of the Tragedies of Sophocles (ISLL 36, 1\endash 2), Urbana 1952, S. 7, 68. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 A. Pertusi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), Scholia vetera in Hesiodi Opera et Dies, Mailand \u8249 \'8b1955\u8250 \'9b, S. XI. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 N. Livadaras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u7993 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8166 ? \u7977 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (\u171 \'ab\u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8118 ?\u187 \'bb \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u7960 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u7961 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Athen 1963, S. 229 (Nr. 78). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 N. G. Wilson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Variant Readings with Poor Support in the Manuscript Tradition, in: RHT 17 (1987), S. 1\endash 13, hier S. 4. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tinnefeld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 320, 330. \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Tsavari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Histoire, S. 81, 88, 93, 134\endash 135, 264, 275.}

