\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \tab \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Stephanus-Katalog\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , ff. 87v\endash 88r. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rwarth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 84. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hardt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   III, S. 124\endash 128. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Pitra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Ius I, S. XIV. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hartig\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 136, 242, 368. \endash  S. Y. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Rudberg\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u201 \'c9tudes sur la tradition manuscrite de saint Basile, Lund 1953, S. 125, 148, 208. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 J. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Gribomont\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u201 \'c9tudes su\u233 \'e9doises et reclassement de la tradition manuscrite de Saint Basile, in: Mus 67 (1954), S. 51\endash 69, hier S. 60. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 M. Smith\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Manuscript Tradition of Isidore of Pelusium, in: Harvard Theological Review 47 (1954), S. 205\endash 210, hier S. 210. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 J. Gribomont\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Les R\u232 \'e8gles \u233 \'e9pistolaires de s. Basile: Lettres 173 et 22, in: Antonianum 54 (1979), S. 255\endash 287, hier S. 258. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tinnefeld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 320 (Anm. 81). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fedwick\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Bibliotheca I, S. 584 (Ap 32); II, 1, S. 525 (h5554); III, S. 114, 425 (i342). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 P. Allen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 B. Neil\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), Scripta saeculi VII vitam Maximi Confessoris illustrantia [\u8230 \'85] (CCSG 39), Turnhout / L\u246 \'f6wen 1999, S. 55, 69. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 B. Roosen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , On the Recent Edition of the \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Disputatio Bizyae\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 . With an Analysis of Chapter XXIV \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  De providentia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   of the \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Florilegium Achridense\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   and an \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Index manuscriptorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   in Appendix, in: J\u214 \'d6B 51 (2001), S. 113\endash 131, hier S. 117\endash 121, 130.}

