\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  10. (ff. 164r, 10. Z.\endash 165v, 6. Z.) Exzerpte verschiedenen Inhalts, darunter Erotapokriseis zum Alten und Neuen Testament, Abschnitte par\u228 \'e4netischen Inhalts und Bibelzitate. \endash  Keine Z\u228 \'e4hlung. \endash  (f. 164r, 10.\endash 17. Z.) Nr. 1: \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Athanasius Alexandrinus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Quaestiones in scripturam sanctam*; quaest. 34\u8250 \'9b (im Ms. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ioannes Chrysostomus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   zugeschrieben: \u7992 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u940 \'dc\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u972 \'fc\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), PG 28, 721 A 13\endash B 9; CPG II 2260. \endash  (f. 164r, 17. Z.\endash 164v, 21. Z.) Nr. 2: \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Theodoretus Cyrensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Quaestiones et responsiones ad orthodoxos*; quaest. 31\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel), PG 6, 1277 C 14\endash D 9 (als unechtes Werk des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Iustinus martyr}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 A. Papadopoulos-Kerameus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u942 \'de\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 