\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \tab \tab (f. 169r) Exzerpte moralisch-asketischen Inhalts aus verschiedenen Autoren: (1.\endash 13. Z.) Nr. 1 (Ms. am Rand: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u972 \'fc\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8150 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7985 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u941 \'dd\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7990 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u972 \'fc\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u942 \'de\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8131 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8135 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8150 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u9