\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \tab (ff. 53r\endash 54v) Liturgischer Text (Menaeum?), fast komplett unlesbar, s. f. 54v, l. Z.: unerkennbarer Canon; Ode \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, Heirmos \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7956 ?[\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ] \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ?], EE, 68 (96); \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Follieri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   IV, S. 248.}

