 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8183 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\u8179 ? \u7969 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u8103 ? \u7969 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ehrhard\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \u220 \'dcberlieferung III, S. 570 (Nr. 62).}

