\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  18. (ff. 305r\endash 308v) In feriam quartam IV \u8249 \'8bQuadragesimae\u8250 \'9b (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8135 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ? \u8165 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u951 \'e7\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3