\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  20. (ff. 311v\endash 316r) In Dominicam IV Quadragesimae (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8135 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u925 \'cd\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7969 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7940 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u952 \'e8\u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lan