\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  34. (ff. 382v\endash 388v) In magnam feriam tertiam (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8135 ? \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\u8115 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8131 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\u903 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u948 \'e4\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7992 ?\u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650