\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \tab \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Konkordanz/Prommer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , f. 129v. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u246 \'f6\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rwarth\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 49\endash 50. \endash \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  Hardt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   III, S. 189\endash 192. \endash  C. F. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ranke\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), Hesiodi quod fertur Scutum Herculis ex recognitione et cum animadversionibus \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Fr. Aug. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Wolfii\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Quedlinburg / Leipzig 1840, S. 114, 292\endash 294 (Hs. benutzt). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H. Flach\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (Hrsg.), Glossen und Scholien zur hesiodischen Theogonie mit Prolegomena, Leipzig 1876, S. 16\endash 21 (Hs. benutzt). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 H. Schultz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die hand\-schriftliche \u220 \'dcberlieferung der Hesiod-Scholien (Abh. Kgl. Ges. Wiss. G\u246 \'f6ttingen, philol.-hist. Kl., N. F. XII, 4), Berlin 1910, S. 16, 58\endash 60, 89. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 N. Livadaras\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , \u7993 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8166 ? \u7977 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   (\u171 \'ab\u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8118 ?\u187 \'bb \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8059 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u957 \'ed\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u7960 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \u7961 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs20 \u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 ), Athen 1963, S. 228\endash 229 (Nr. 77). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 M. L. West\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Medieval and Renaissance Manuscripts of Hesiod\rquote s Theogony, in: CQ 14 (1964), S. 165\endash 189, hier S. 184, 186 (Nr. 63). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 L. Di Gregorio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sulla tradizione manoscritta degli \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Scholia vetera\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   alla \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Teogonia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   di Esiodo, I. Le copie del Marc. gr. 464 (= 762), in: Aevum 45 (1971), S. 1\endash 24, hier S. 24. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ders.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sulla tradizione \u8230 \'85, III. I codici contaminati, ebd., S. 383\endash 408, hier S. 403\endash 405. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Ders.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sulla tradizione \u8230 \'85, IV. Conclusioni, in: Aevum 46 (1972), S. 1\endash 15, hier S. 1\endash 3, 8. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 A. Diller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , The Textual Tradition of Strabo\rquote s Geography. With appendix: The Manuscripts of Eustathius\rquote  Commentary on Dionysius Periegetes, Amsterdam 1975, S. 184, 187\endash 188. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tsavari\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Histoire, S. 81, 133\endash 134, 316\endash 317, 320\endash 328. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Y. Corrales \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 P\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u233 \'e9\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 rez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Die \u220 \'dcberlieferungsgeschichte des pseudohesiodischen Scutum Herculis, Diss. Hamburg 1994, S. 44\endash 45, 225\endash 227. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hajd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u250 \'fa\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20  / Schreiner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Nikolaos, S. 42, 43.}

