\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1. (ff. IIIv\endash 24r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cicero}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , De senectute, griech. \u220 \'dcbersetzung von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Theodorus Gaza}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Recensio \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) (Ms. f. IIIv \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u965 \'f5\u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u929 \'d1\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8001 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u950 \'e6\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7970 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u903 ? \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u945 \'e1\u950 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7961 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u967 \'f7\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Salanitro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Theodorus Gaza (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 2\endash 62, u. a. nach dieser Hs.; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Megas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 54\endash 94, u. a. nach dieser Hs. \endash  Auf f. IIIv oben Standortsignatur und Besitz\-vermerk des Florentiner Klosters San Marco (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), heute getilgt; unmittelbar unter dem Titel lat. Inhaltsangabe (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Am Textende: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8061 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u945 \'e1\u950 \'e6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7961 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u955 \'eb\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u967 \'f7\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

