\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Anhand der knappen Inhaltsbeschreibung im Hardt-Katalog (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) l\u228 \'e4\u223 \'dft sich vermuten, dass die Hs. die griech. \u220 \'dcbersetzung des \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Annus astrologicus in dies singulos feliciter agendos distributus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   von \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Thomas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  von\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Kempen \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  enthielt, ed. (lat.) Annus astrologicus in dies singulos feliciter agendos distributus auctore \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Thoma de Kempis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85, \u8249 \'8bKonstanz\u8250 \'9b 1630: Ms. \u7960 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ? \u7953 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7969 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u952 \'e8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u947 \'e3\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u949 \'e5\u956 \'ec\u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u915 \'c3\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8060 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   1. \u8222 \'84\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u972 \'fc\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u942 \'de\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8048 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u940 \'dc\u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u972 \'fc\u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \ldblquote  (Eccl. 1, 2) \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ?. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. Annus astrologicus, S. 10 (Eccl. 1, 2 [\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Vulg.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ]) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vanitas vanitatum et omnia vanitas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   eqs. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7984 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8249 \'8b\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8250 \'9b \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ?, vgl. Annus astrologicus, S. 20 oder 50 (act. 14, 21). \endash  Anschlie\u223 \'dfend, gem\u228 \'e4\u223 \'df der Hardt-Beschreibung: Gebet (?) (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u951 \'e7\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ., \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Maximus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Planudes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Catonis Disticha moralia Graece versa\u8250 \'9b (?) (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8182 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\u964 \'f4\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?), Carmina in sanctissimam Matrem Dei (Ms. \u7948 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8134 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7937 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u953 \'e9\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \u8038 ? \u7969 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8150 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8183 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8057 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8179 ?.}

