\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\b\i\lang1033\fs20 Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  \tab \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 A. Welfinger\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Libri in papyro manuscripti pertinentes ad residentiam societatis Jesu Ebersbergensem, 1768 = \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Clm\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   1387, ff. 21v\endash 27v, hier f. 27v. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Cbm Cat. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs20  30, S. 78. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hardt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   III, S. 304\endash 305. \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Tinnefeld\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 320, 330, 341 (Anm. 141). \endash  \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 Hajd\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 \u250 \'fa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Sammlung, S. 89. \endash  R\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs20 ollo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , Gli \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs20  Erotemata\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20 , S. 59, 148\endash 151 und Abb. XXVI.}

