\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1. (ff. 1r\endash 2r) Tabelle und kurze lat. Kapitel \u252 \'fcber griech. Alphabet, Vokale, Diphthonge und Akzente. \endash  (f. 1r) griech. Alphabet (Tabelle) (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De litteris graecis brevis explanatio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Alpha a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Vita\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   eqs. \endash  Auf f. 1r am oberen Rand Besitzvermerk der Ebersberger Jesuitenresidenz (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und Abb. 115). \endash  (f. 1v) \u8249 \'8b\u220 \'dcber griech. Vokale\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel); inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vocales apud Grecos sunt septem videlicet}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  \u945 a \u949 e \u970 ? \u951 ? \u959 ? \u956 \'b5\u953 ?\u954 ?\u961 ?\u8056 ?\u957 ? \u965 ? \u968 ?\u953 ?\u955 ?\u8056 ?\u957 ? \u954 ?\u945 a\u8054 ? \u969 ? \u956 \'b5\u8051 ?\u947 ?\u945 a eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (ff. 1v\endash 2r) \u220 \'dcber griech. Diphthonge (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De diphthongis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u916 ?\u943 ?\u966 f\u952 ?\u959 ?\u947 ?\u947 ?\u959 ?\u943 ? \u949 e\u7984 ?\u963 s\u953 ?\u957 ? \u7957 ?\u958 ?\u903 ? \u945 a\u953 ? \u945 a\u965 ? \u949 e\u953 ? \u949 e\u965 ? \u959 ?\u953 ? \u959 ?\u965 ?, \u945 a\u953 ? }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 sonat e apud Latinos}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (f. 2r) \u8249 \'8b\u220 \'dcber griech. Prosodie\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8179 ?}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17 \u948 \'e4}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8055 ?}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17 \u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 id est accentus sunt isti}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 : }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17 \u959 \'ef\u958 \'ee\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 id est acutus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24\chcbpat17 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 id est gravis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Unmittelbar darunter nicht komplett entzifferbare Exzerpte aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Priscianus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Institutiones Grammaticae; lib. I 1\endash II 5, ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 M. Hertz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Prisciani grammatici Caesariensis Institutionum Grammaticarum libri XVIII. Vol. I libros I\endash XII continens (Grammatici Latini II, 1), Leipzig 1855, S. 5\endash 7; inc. S. 5, 3 (lib. I 1, 3) \u7964 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Litterae habent altitudinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in tenore, crassitudinem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  vel latitudinem in spiritu, longitudinem in tempore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   eqs. des. S. 7, 14 (lib. I 5, 14) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  similiter aliae vocales possunt proferri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

