\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  4. (ff. 150v\endash 151r) \u8249 \'8bDe virtutibus moralibus cum extremis vitiis\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel); inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Item decem sunt virtutes morales, quarum prima est fortitudo \u8230 \'85 audacia \u8230 \'85 timiditas; temperancia \u8230 \'85 intemperancia \u8230 \'85 insensualitas; prodigalitas \u8230 \'85 liberalitas \u8230 \'85 illiberalitas \u8230 \'85 bonausia \u8230 \'85 magnificencia \u8230 \'85 paruificencia }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iactancia \u8230 \'85 veritas \u8230 \'85 yronia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  distolia \u8230 \'85 affabilitas \u8230 \'85 placiditas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   bomolochia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (scil. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u969 \'f9\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 eutrapalia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (scil. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 agrykya \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (scil. \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). Zehn Dreiergruppen mit interlinearen Erkl\u228 \'e4rungen, z. B. zu fortitudo (f. 150v): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Et est habitus inclinans ad aggrediendum uel fugiendum ubi oportet et quando oportet.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Vgl. BSB, Cgm 1586, f. 27r, und Clm 28633, f. 80v.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  Anschlie\u223 \'dfend: (f. 151v) Erkl\u228 \'e4rungen zu \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  passiones, subiectum, obiectum, actus cuiuslibet virtutis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ms. ohne Titel); inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Obiectum materiale extrinsecum est terribile, sed obiectum intrinsecum est passio }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Text endet abrupt in der Mitte des Blattes. \endash  (151Ar\endash 152r) leer, bis auf Federproben.}

