\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 184r\endash 186v, 187v\endash 188r) Excerpta de mineralibus. \endash  (f. 184r\endash v) Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De spiritibus mineralibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; inc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Spiritus autem minerales sunt sulphur, auripigmentum, sal harmoniacum, mercurius \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (f. 185r\endash v) Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De corporibus mineralibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Seneca de naturalibus questionibus libro 7: Sicut in nobis non tantum est sanguis, sed multa genera humorum, alia quidem neccessarii, alia quoque corrupti}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (ff. 185v\endash 186v) Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De auro\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Isydorus: Aurum ab aura dicitur }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (ff. 187v\endash 188r) Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De argento\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  ; inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Isydorus libro 14: Argentum Gr\u553 ?ci}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  \u7936 ?\u961 ?\u947 ?\u8059 ?\u961 ?\u953 ?\u959 ?\u957 ? }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 dicunt}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  in examine argenti similiter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tria scilicet ignis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   cinis et plumbum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. Hortus sanitatis, De lapidibus, wo die Anfangss\u228 \'e4tze des Pro\u246 \'f6miums sowie der Kap. 18 und 20 mit einigen Anfangss\u228 \'e4tzen unseres Textes \u252 \'fcbereinstimmen, s. L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Hain\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Repertorium bibliographicum, II, 1, Stuttgart / Paris 1831, *8941\u8722 -*8944; L. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Thorndike / P. Kibre\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , A Catalogue of Incipits of Mediaeval Scientific Writings in Latin. Revised and Augmented Edition, London \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1963, Sp. 1427, 13. \endash  (ff. 187r, 188v\endash 188Ev) leer.}

