\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1. (ff. 194r\endash 197r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Udalricus Eberhardus de Neuburga Claustrali}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Tractatus de ortho\-graphia (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tractulus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   h \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [durchgestrichen] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  orthographie magistri Vdalrici Eberhardi de Neuburga Claustrali incipit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. GW 9186\u8722 -9209 (au\u223 \'dfer 9187, 9193, 9196); inc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Per quam multe quidem dictiones sunt in quarum figuracione plurimi orthographie ignari sepe numero oberrare videntur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  eqs. des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ea scripsisse nunc satis est. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Vgl. auch \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 F. J. Worstbrock,\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Art. Eberhardi (Ebrardi), Ulrich, in: \plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs24 2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  VL, Bd. 2 (1980), Sp. 287\endash 288. \endash  Am Textende: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Tractatulus orthographie magistri Vdalrici Eberhardi de Neunburga Claustrali finit feliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. 197v) leer.}

