\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 199r\endash 203r, 204r\endash v) \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Laurentius de Londorio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?), Quaestiones super Aristotelis octo libros Physicorum; quaest. I 1\endash 3\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Gesamttitel), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Johannes Buridanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Quaestio\-nes super octo libros Physicorum Aristotelis, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 E. D. Sylla, \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  Guide to the text, in: \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 M. Streijger / P. J. J. M. Bakker\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Hrsg.), John Buridan, \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quaestiones super octo libros Physi\-corum Aristotelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  secundum ultimam lecturam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Libri I\endash II\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (History of Science and Medicine Library 50. Medieval and Early Modern Science 25), Leiden \u8249 \'8b2015\u8250 \'9b, S. LXX\u8722 -LXXXII (Quaestio\-nes I, 1\u8722 -3 stimmen im Wortlaut der Fragestellung am meisten \u252 \'fcberein mit denen bei Laurentius de Londorio). \endash  (f. 199r\endash v) Prolog mit Inhaltsverzeichnis der acht B\u252 \'fccher der Aristoteles (Ms. ohne Titel); inc. mut. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u8230 \'85] aut corruptionem diuersorum mixtorum in speciali \u8230 \'85 Primus liber determinat de principiis intrinsecus rerum naturalium}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  octauus dicit de primo motore. Finis prologi super philosophia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 200r\endash 203r, 204r\endash v) Liber I (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  1\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 us\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   phisicorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): (ff. 200r\endash 201v) \u8249 \'8bQuaestio 1\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel); inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vtrum scientia naturalis sit de omnibus rebus mundi. Questio ista est incidentaliter, non mota principaliter}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (ff. 202r\endash 203r) \u8249 \'8bQuaestio 2\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel); inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vtrum in totali scientia naturali sit assignandum subiectum proprium et adequatum. Subiectum generaliter sic dicitur}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (f. 203v) leer. \endash  (f. 204r\endash v) \u8249 \'8bQuaestio 3\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel); inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Vtrum ens mobile sit subiectum tocius scientie naturalis. Subiecti diuisio habita est in questione precedenti}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   des. mut. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  tunc sit meta\-phy\-sic\u553 ? considerationis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [\u8230 \'85}

