\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2. (ff. 2r\endash 4v, 5r\endash v) Griech. liturgische Gebetstexte, oft mit lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung, vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sicherl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Neue Reuchliniana (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 74; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Knauer\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Collectanea (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 33\endash 34. Alle Texte mit den jeweiligen lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzungen auch im II. Teil, Nr. 3 (ff. 81r\endash 82v, 83v, 84r).
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \tab (ff. 2r\endash 4r) Aus der Megale Octoechus, ed. Parakletike. \endash  \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7982 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, Sonntag (Orthros), Parakletike, S. 9\endash 21: (f. 2r) \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ioannes Damascenus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Canones anastasimi*; Canon \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7969 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u958 \'ee\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ode \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, Theotokion)\u8250 \'9b (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [!] \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7937 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Am Rand: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4), Parakletike, S. 11; \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Christ\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   / \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Paranikas\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 233a, 17\endash 21; CPG III 8070. Mit lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung; inc\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ave fons gratie, ave scala et porta celestis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   Am unteren Rand Bleistiftvermerk von einer modernen Hand (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (f. 2v) \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cosmas Hierosolymitanus}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Canon stauroanastasimus \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u963 \'f3\u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u8118 ?\u964 \'f4\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u958 \'ee\u8049 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Theotokion\u8250 \'9b (Ms. z. T. weggeschnitten \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4), Parakletike, S. 12. Mit lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung; inc\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Deum, Virgo, concepisti, Christum in virginitate peperisti}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (f. 3r\endash 3v, 11. Z.)\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8bCanon in sanctissimam Deiparam \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7969 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u958 \'ee\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , 1. und 2. Troparion\u8250 \'9b\plain \f1\lang1033\fs20   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (im Ms. als einzelne Gebete betrachtet: f. 3r \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4. f. 3v \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4), Parakletike, S. 12; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   f. 3v \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ut sup\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ra\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), d. h. Parakletike, S. 12, 18 \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\u8150 ?\u961 \'f1\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8057 ?\u954 \'ea\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u952 \'e8\u941 \'dd\u957 \'ed\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u8134 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7936 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. f. 3r, 7.\endash 8. Z. Mit lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung: (f. 3r) inc\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Quam tibi cantorum ipsa nostra offeret infirmitas}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (f. 3v) inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Huic semper Virgini et Matri ipsius Regis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \endash  (f. 3v, 12.\endash 16. Z.) \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7982 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u8059 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sonntag (Orthros); \u8249 \'8bAnabathmoi, Antiphonon \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, 3. Troparion\u8250 \'9b (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ? \u987 ?\plain \f2\lang1066\fs24 \u803 ?\u180 \'b4 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  [?]\u903 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Parakletike, S. 539\endash 550: S. 540. \endash  (f. 4r) \u8249 \'8b\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Ioannes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Damascenus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Canones anastasimi*; Canon \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7969 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\u967 \'f7\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u958 \'ee\u953 \'e9\u8049 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Ode \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4, Theotokion)\u8250 \'9b (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u949 \'e5\u965 \'f5\u967 \'f7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8052 ? \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4\u903 ? \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), Parakletike, S. 12\endash 13. Mit unvollst\u228 \'e4ndiger lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung; inc\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://