\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \tab (f. 6v): (3.\endash 10. Z.) Exzerpt 5: Epitaphium Sophoclis (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u7960 ?\u960 \'f0\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\u961 \'f1\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u8055 ?\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8182 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u966 \'f6\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [!] \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\u959 \'ef\u966 \'f6\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u955 \'eb\u8051 ?\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  o\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [!] \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8049 ?\u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 A. C. Pearson\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Sophoclis fabulae, Oxford 1924, S. XX (Vita Sophoclis 15). Mit lat. \u220 \'dcbersetzung; inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Condo sub hoc tumulo Sophoclen primatum habentem}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (11.\endash 14. Z.) Exzerpt 6: aus \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Maximus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Tyrius\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Diss. IV 1 (Ms. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u945 \'e1\u958 \'ee\u8055 ?\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u953 \'e9\u954 \'ea\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u953 \'e9\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\f