\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  1. (f. 247r\endash 247v, 11. Z.) Exzerpte aus {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ioannes Tortellius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (Giovanni Tortelli),\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8249 \'8bDe ortho\-graphia dictionum e Graecis tractarum\u8250 \'9b (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ex Turtellio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ed. princ.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?), Venedig: Nicolas Jenson 1471; BSB-Ink-T-384; GW M47219; ISTC it00395000. Mit Textabweichungen. Vgl. auch VIII. Teil, Nr. 2 (f. 184r, 12.\endash 32. Z.). Vgl. dazu \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Sicherl\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Neue Reuchliniana (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 80. \endash  (f. 247r, 1.\endash 13. Z.) Exzerpt 1 (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De littera a\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): vgl. f. \u8249 \'8b3\u8250 \'9bv, 14. Z. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nonnumquam ubi Greci a scribunt, Latini solent mutare in o. Exempla\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  marmor\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 f. \u8249 \'8b3\u8250 \'9bv, 17. Z. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  pro\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u966 \'f6\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (!), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  scribe\-bant\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. 247r, 14. Z.\endash 247v, 11. Z.) Exzerpt 2 (Ms. \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs24 \u914 \'c2\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 . P.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   [!]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\i\lang1032\fs24 \u936 \'d8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ): vgl. f. \u8249 \'8b3\u8250 \'9bv, 31. Z. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Mutam aliquando per p, aliquando per ph: \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8059 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u958 \'ee\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  buxus \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   f. \u8249 \'8b4\u8250 \'9br, 14. Z. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u948 \'e4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  rhodos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

