h  (ff. 205r\endash 207r) Griech.-lat. Glossar. \endash  Exzerpte aus den griech. Buchstaben \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u918 \'c6\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u919 \'c7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u921 \'c9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u920 \'c8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u927 \'cf\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u929 \'d1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u931 \'d3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u936 \'d8\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u935 \'d7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u937 \'d9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Goetz\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 123, 6 \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  audio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\u965 \'f5\u963 \'f3\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   audi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u945 \'e1\u952 \'e8\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  bonus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u8230 \'85 S. 166, 9 \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iurasti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  iuraverunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lan