 \endash  Am Textende (f. 214r): Glossen (?): \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u929 \'d1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u947 \'e3\u965 \'f5\u949 \'e5\u956 \'ec\u903 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u963 \'f3\u963 \'f3\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u966 \'f6\u949 \'e5\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

