\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2. (ff. 233r\endash 236v. 153r) \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Guarinus Veronensis}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , De diphthongis\u8250 \'9b (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De diccionibus diptongandis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Non sine causa diptongandis vocabulis \{diptongandis\} operam impenderunt maiores nostri \u8230 \'85 Diptongus est duarum vocalium cum singule vocem suam servent in eadem sillaba complexio}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Troezenus, scoenabates, consensor funium, Croesus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Guarinus Veronensis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Regulae grammaticales, Venedig: [Nicolaus Jenson], 1474, Bl. 38b\endash 45b; BSB-Ink-G-419; GW 11638; ISTC ig00534300. In der Hs. gek\u252 \'fcrzte Textfassung, vgl. Melk, Benediktinerstift, Cod. 1225 (\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  olim\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   656, L 86), ff. 145r\endash 148r (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Ch.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Glassner\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , die im digitalen Handschrifteninventar des \u214 \'d6sterreichische Akademievorhabens \u8222 \'84manuscripta.at\ldblquote  (Mittelalterliche Handschriften in \u214 \'d6sterreich) aufrufbar ist.}

