\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  3. (ff. 153r\endash 156r) \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Gasparinus Barzizius}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (?), De modo punctandi\u8250 \'9b (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Modus punctandi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Ad evidenciam doctrine punctandi quinque sunt advertenda: primo quid sit punctum}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  summo dolore confici\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. Cod. Neap. lat. V C 34, ff. 25r\endash 26v (vgl. P. O. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Kristeller\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Iter Italicum. A Finding List of Uncatalogued or Incompletely Catalogued Humanistic Mss of the Renaissance in Italian and Other Libraries, I. Italy: Agrigento to Novara, London / Leiden 1963, S. 400, und \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 C. Cenci\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Manoscritti francescani della Biblioteca Nazionale di Napoli, I [Spicilegium Bonaventurianum VII], Florenz 1971, S. 202\endash 203 [Nr. 12]), hier S. 203); vgl. Cod. Bodl. canon. miscell. 12, f. 67v (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Coxe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Catalogi III, Sp. 444\endash 445, hier Sp. 445). Vgl. auch Venedig, Biblioteca del Museo Civico Correr, Cod. Correr 334, ff. 170r\endash 175v (vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 E. J. Polak\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Medieval and Renaissance Letter Treatises and Form Letters. A Census of Manuscripts Found in Part of Europe \u8230 \'85, Leiden / Boston 2015, S. 770).}

