\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  6. (ff. 159r\endash 160v) De accentibus (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  De accentibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 In cantu accentus non observatur}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17  eqs.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  sed in metro zizania platea indifferenter reperiuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Vgl. auch Augsburg, Staats- und Stadtbibliothek, 2\u176 \'b0 Cod. 213, ff. 175v\endash 177r (s. Nr. 4).\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \endash  Am Textende: \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u956 \'ec\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u945 \'e1\u965 \'f5\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

