\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  2. (f. 186r\endash 190r) Verschiedene griech. und lat. Notizen. \endash  (f. 186r): (1.\endash 8. Z.) \u220 \'dcber die griech. Artikeldeklination (griech.-lat.); \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u7960 ?\u957 ?\u953 ?\u954 ?\u8049 ?, \u7936 ?\u961 ?\u963 s\u949 e\u957 ?\u953 ?\u954 ?\u8049 ?\u903 ? \u8001 ?, \u964 t\u959 ?\u8166 ?, \u964 t\u8183 ?, \u964 t\u8056 ?\u957 ? \u954 ?\u964 t\u955 ?.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8135 ?, \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8053 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , vgl. auch ff. 188r\endash 189r. \endash  (9.\endash 12. Z.) nicht entzifferbare hebr. Notiz. \endash  (13.\endash 14. Z.) \u8249 \'8b{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Cicero}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , De natura deorum; I 42\u8250 \'9b (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  M. T. C.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (15. Z.) lat. Notiz (Bezug unklar): \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Omphacium vinum artificio scilicet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (f. 186v) chronometrische Tafel (Ms. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Quantis dierum et noctuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ab ortu solis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  usque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ad occasum secundum tactum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  horologiorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  haec metiuntur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ); inc. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Nativitas Christi: Dies 9, Nox 15 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  eqs. des. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  3 die post Andree. Dies 8, Nox 16\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 187r\endash 190r) \u220 \'dcber die griech. Grammatik und Prosodie (Vokale, Diphthonge, Konso\-nanten, Akzente, Artikeldeklination, I. und II. Deklination von Nomen);  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 \u934 F\u969 ?\u957 ?\u942 ?\u949 e\u957 ?\u964 t\u945 a \u7953 ?\u960 p\u964 t\u940 ?\u903 ? \u945 a, \u949 e, \u951 ?, \u953 ?, \u959 ? \u956 \'b5\u953 ?\u954 ?\u961 ?\u8057 ?\u957 ?, \u965 ? \u968 ?\u953 ?\u955 ?\u8056 ?\u957 ? \u954 ?\u964 t\u955 ?.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  des. \plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u924 \'cc\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ?\plain \f3\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u945 \'e1\u953 \'e9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .}

