\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\cf1 3. (ff. 118r\endash 178r) Synaxarium (s. Nr. 1): Evangelienlesungen f\u252 \'fcr die Tage von der 1. Woche nach Ostern bis zum Pfingstsonntag; Texte der Lesungen meist aus dem Iohannes-Evangelium, ed. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8016 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u945 \'e1\u947 \'e3\u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8051 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u955 \'eb\u953 \'e9\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , S. 1\endash 22; vgl. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Gregory\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a. O, I, S. 344\endash 347. \endash  Durchgehend Neumennotation und ekphonetische Zeichen in brauner Tinte.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx360\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \tab (f. 118r, 1. Sp.\endash 120r, 2. Sp.) I hebdomas: (f. 118r, 1. Sp.\endash 118v, 1. Sp.) \u8249 \'8bSabbatum \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u916 \'c4\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u953 \'e9\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u956 \'ec\u959 \'ef\u965 \'f5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Ioann. 3, 22\endash 33\u8250 \'9b; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  inc. mut.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   3, 27 \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u954 \'ea\u961 \'f1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u952 \'e8\u951 \'e7\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \u7992 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8054 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u7990 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u949 \'e5\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u964 \'f4\u955 \'eb\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 118v, 1. Sp.\endash 120r, 2. Sp.) Dominica \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Ioann. 20, 19\endash 31 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8135 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \u7944 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8055 ?\-\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u945 \'e1\u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   am oberen Rand. \u7960 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8048 ? \u7992 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u969 \'f9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u957 \'ed\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  (ff. 120r, 2. Sp.\endash 129r, 2. Sp.) II hebdomas: (ff. 120r, 2. Sp.\endash 121r, 2. Sp.) Feria secunda II hebdom.: Ioann. 2, 1\endash 11. \endash  (ff. 121r, 2. Sp.\endash 122r, 1. Sp.) Feria tertia II hebdom.: Ioann. 3, 16\endash 21. \endash  (ff. 122r, 1. Sp.\endash 123r, 2. Sp.) Feria quarta II hebdom.: Ioann. 5, 17\endash 24. \endash  (ff. 123r, 2. Sp.\endash 124r, 1. Sp.) Feria quinta II hebdom.: Ioann. 5, 24\endash 30. \endash  (ff. 124r, 1. Sp.\endash 126r, 1. Sp.) Parasceve II hebdom.: Ioann. 5, 30\endash 6, 2. \endash  (ff. 126r, 1. Sp.\endash 127v, 2. Sp.) Sabbatum II hebdom.: Ioann. 6, 14\endash 27. \endash  (ff. 127v, 2. Sp.\endash 129r, 2. Sp.) Dominica secunda \u7936 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8056 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u928 \'d0\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8049 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u963 \'f3\u967 \'f7\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 : Marc. 15, 43\endash 16, 8 (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u922 \'ca\u965 \'f5\u961 \'f1\u953 \'e9\u945 \'e1\u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8135 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u947 \'e3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u180 \'b4 [Ostersonntag mitgez\u228 \'e4hlt]\u903 ? \u7952 ?\plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8166 ? \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u954 \'ea\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\plain 