\pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (ff. 1r\endash 96r) Anonymer Kommentar zu \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  Aristoteles\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , Ars rhetorica (Ms. ohne Titel), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ed. pr.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u921 \'c9\u931 \'d3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u919 \'c7\u925 \'cd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u929 \'d1\u921 \'c9\u931 \'d3\u932 \'d4\u927 \'cf\u932 \'d4\u917 \'c5\u923 \'cb\u927 \'cf\u933 \'d5\u931 \'d3\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u933 \'d5\u928 \'d0\u927 \'cf\u924 \'cc\u925 \'cd\u919 \'c7\u924 \'cc\u913 \'c1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u913 \'c1\u925 \'cd\u937 \'d9\u925 \'cd\u933 \'d5\u927 \'cf\u925 \'cd\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Nunc primum in lucem editur \u8230 \'85, Paris: Conradus Neobarius, 1539; ed. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs24 Rabe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Lit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ), S. 1\endash 262.
\par \pard\sl360\slmult1\fi0\li0\tx420\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \tab (ff. 1r\endash 36r) \u8249 \'8bLib. I\u8250 \'9b (Ms. ohne Titel). \endash  (f. 1r) am oberen Rand Notiz vom Schreiber zum l\u252 \'fcckenhaften Textzustand, unten Notiz von Martin Crusius (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a) zum Erwerb der Hs., s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  Am Textende (f. 36r): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u960 \'f0\u961 \'f1\u8182 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 36v\endash 59v) Lib. II (Ms. \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Am Textende (f. 59v): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u8166 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u949 \'e5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u948 \'e4\u949 \'e5\u8059 ?\u964 \'f4\u949 \'e5\u961 \'f1\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u959 \'ef\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u8053 ?\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 59v\endash 96r) Lib. III (Ms. [am oberen Rand, s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , c] \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u917 \'c5\u7984 ?\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u8056 ?\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u964 \'f4\u961 \'f1\u8055 ?\u964 \'f4\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u946 \'e2\u953 \'e9\u946 \'e2\u955 \'eb\u8055 ?\u959 \'ef\u957 \'ed\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u8017 ?\u960 \'f0\u8057 ?\u956 \'ec\u957 \'ed\u951 \'e7\u956 \'ec\u945 \'e1\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Am Textende (f. 96r): \plain \f2\lang1032\fs24 \u932 \'d4\u8051 ?\u955 \'eb\u959 \'ef\u962 \'f2\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . Nebenan Angabe zur Blattanzahl und Notiz zum Erwerb der Hs., allesamt von Martin Crusius, s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , a und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Pr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 . \endash  (ff. 96v\endash 96Ar) leer. \endash  (f. 96Av) aufgeklebter Kartonstreifen aus dem alten Einband (s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  E\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24   und \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Ez\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ) mit griech./lat. Notiz, s. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 , d.}
